<text pos="432 192" stroke="0.45" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">world frame</text>
<text pos="72 92" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$(x,y)$, $\theta$ \quad the pose: the middle of the body, and where it points</text>
<text pos="72 75" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$\delta$ \quad steering angle of the front wheel, $|\delta| \le 22^\circ$ \quad ($\delta = \delta_{\max} u / 100$)</text>
<text pos="72 58" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$\beta$ \quad side slip angle, $\beta = \arctan\!\left(\frac{l_r}{L}\tan\delta\right)$ \quad the car travels along $\theta + \beta$, not along $\theta$</text>
<text pos="72 41" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$L = 0.12$ m \quad wheelbase, with $l_r = l_f = 0.06$ m</text>
<text pos="72 24" stroke="0" type="label" halign="left" valign="baseline" size="small">$\mathrm{bodyL} = 0.22$ m, $\mathrm{bodyW} = 0.105$ m \quad what has to fit between the walls</text>
